OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith rain spreading southeastwards and
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy at times. Strong winds
OL,9,Fthrough the evening but easing
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAny lingering rain clearing
OL,13,Fto the southeast in the morning.
OL,14,FMostly dry in the afternoon with just
OL,15,Fthe odd shower possible and brighter
OL,16,Fspells breaking through. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
