OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,For sunny spells on Friday with the odd
OL,7,Fshower. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,8,Fand light winds through the weekend.
OL,9,FChillier nights than of late.
